Right now the total... the total amount right now is 550,000 yen-noja.

1970
02:05:23,446 --> 02:05:26,146
のじゃちゃん、さっきのお返ししていい？
Noja-chan, can I pay you back for earlier?

1971
02:05:25,446 --> 02:05:26,146
はい。
Yes.

1972
02:05:28,546 --> 02:05:29,746
こよちゃん今…
Koyo-chan, right now...

1973
02:05:29,746 --> 02:05:30,346
はい。
Yes.

1974
02:05:30,396 --> 02:05:31,846
101万…
1.01 million...

1975
02:05:31,846 --> 02:05:35,746
のじゃーーー！あー！3桁ーーー！
Nojaaa! Ahh! Three digits!

1976
02:05:35,896 --> 02:05:42,246
やばい。やっぱ頭脳か。運とかないか、この世界。運とかないわ。頭脳や。
This is bad. It really is about brains, huh. There's no luck or anything in this world. No luck at all. It's brains.

1977
02:05:42,746 --> 02:05:45,246
ど負け。頭脳にど負けや。
Total defeat. Totally defeated by brains.

1978
02:05:45,646 --> 02:05:47,046
