Next is 3,000 meters.

1982
02:05:58,846 --> 02:06:03,246
やっぱスピードと多分ね、最初のスタートダッシュ、瞬発力だから…
It's probably Speed and, you know, the initial start dash, the burst power...

1983
02:06:06,546 --> 02:06:09,046
スピードも欲しいし…瞬発？
We want Speed too, and... burst?

1984
02:06:13,446 --> 02:06:17,446
1が意外と…ちょ、調子次第じゃけど。
1 is surprisingly... well, depending on condition, though.

1985
02:06:17,746 --> 02:06:20,446
え、100万当ててる？すごい！
Huh, someone won a million? Amazing!

1986
02:06:25,246 --> 02:06:30,546
何かな。3はまあ硬そう。なんかその、パドック見次第じゃけど。
I wonder what. 3 seems pretty solid. Well, depending on how the paddock looks, though.

1987
02:06:32,246 --> 02:06:38,746
2も…でも逃げか。2も…調子を見て。
2 also... wait, it's a Front runner. 2 also... I'll check its condition.

1988
02:06:41,946 --> 02:06:43,946
3、7？3、7…
3, 7? 3, 7...

1989
02:06:47,346 --> 02:06:50,946
やっぱ3、7か。
Is it 3 and 7 after all?

1990
02:06:55,346 --> 02:06:59,846
あ、第4レース最後か。最後なら3連単やりたいのじゃ、わしも確かに。
Oh, Race 4 is the last one? If it's the last one, I definitely want to try a Trifecta too-noja.

1991
02:07:00,146 --> 02:07:17,246
え、でもちょ、調子見次第じゃけど、調子見次第じゃけど、一旦、3、7…3、7、2で…1。1。でもスピード高いな。3走前1位か。
Uh, well, depending on how their condition looks, depending on their condition, for now, 3, 7... 3, 7, 2 and... 1. 1. It has high Speed, though. 1st place 3 races ago, huh.

1992
02:07:17,946 --> 02:07:20,946
ラスト全ぶっぱしたい、全ぶっぱしたい。全ぶっぱ。
For the last one, I wanna go all-in, I wanna go all-in. All-in.

1993
02:07:21,646 --> 02:07:28,546
ちょ、3連単…ちょ、ワイドとかもやりつつ3連単も入れつつでいきたいのじゃ。ドカンと当てたい。
Wait, Trifecta... I want to do some Wide bets while also putting in a Trifecta-noja. I wanna hit it big.

1994
02:07:31,246 --> 02:07:34,646
大穴、1大穴。オッズとかも見つつ。
Long shot, 1 is a long shot. While also checking the odds and stuff.

1995
02:07:38,946 --> 02:07:41,246
ガチでパドックしたい。ガチでパドックしたいじゃが。
I want to seriously inspect the paddock. I really want to do the paddock seriously.

1996
02:07:49,346 --> 02:08:01,346
どうしよっかなー。ちょ、さっき痛い目見たから、さっき痛い目見たから、堅実に行きたい気持ちはありつつ、最後のレースじゃから、頑張りたい。
What should I do? Since I got burned earlier, since I got burned earlier, part of me wants to play it safe, but since it's the final race, I want to give it my all.

1997
02:08:01,746 --> 02:08:06,646
こより先輩にやっぱマウント返ししたいわ、わし。マウント返ししたいのじゃ。
I really want to flex back on Koyori-senpai. I want to flex back on her-noja.

1998
02:08:07,046 --> 02:08:13,746
ね、2、7いいよな。2、7…いいけど、調子次第。
Right, 2 and 7 look good, huh. 2 and 7... look good, but it depends on condition.

1999
02:08:15,846 --> 02:08:22,346
1だっていい。スピードがあるね。1、スピードあるから熱いな。1、2、7。
Even 1 is good. It's got Speed. 1 has Speed, so it's exciting. 1, 2, 7.

2000
02:08:23,546 --> 02:08:31,046
3連単1点？配信者すぎんか、わし。わし…いけるか？
A single-ticket Trifecta? Isn't that way too streamer-brained of me? Can I... pull it off?

2001
02:08:31,246 --> 02:08:33,946
行くのにぶっぱしかない。3、2…
There's nothing left to do but go all-in. 3, 2...

2002
02:08:37,046 --> 02:08:47,746
うーん、でも確かに今日しか使えないお金じゃから。いや、3…
Hmm, well, it really is money I can only use today, after all. No, 3...

2003
02:08:48,746 --> 02:08:52,746
でもパドック次第。なんか調子が超悪かったら考え直す。
Well, it depends on the paddock. If their condition is super bad, I'll rethink it.

2004
